  <phrase title="option_explain.botIntelAggressiveHits" version_id="1000010" version_string="1.0b"><![CDATA[How many requests a rate-limited robot family or aggressive unknown bot can make within the window before Bot Intel returns 429.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.botIntelAggressiveWindow" version_id="1000010" version_string="1.0b"><![CDATA[The rolling window, in seconds, used for known aggressive crawlers and high-confidence unknown bots.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.botIntelAhrefsAction" version_id="1000010" version_string="1.0b"><![CDATA[Choose whether Ahrefs should only be classified, throttled with 429, or denied with 403 once it exceeds its dedicated rate limit.]]></phrase>
